%N A399615 Number of non-isomorphic perfect hierarchical matching (PHM) trees on 2^n vertices.
%H A399615 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A399615/b399615.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..11</a>
%H A399615 I. Ludden, E. Veomett, and S. Jacobson, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/s10878-026-01458-9">Perfect Hierarchical Matchings in Graphs</a>, Journal of Combinatorial Optimization, Volume 52, article no. 19 (2026).
%F A399615 a(n) = 2^(2^n-2*n-1)+2^(2^(n-1)-n-1).
%t A399615 A399615[n_] := 2^(2^n - 2*n - 1) + 2^(2^(n-1) - n - 1);
%t A399615 Array[A399615, 9] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Sep 12 2026 *)
%o A399615 (Python)
%o A399615 def a(n):
%o A399615     return 2**(2**n-2*n-1)+2**(2**(n-1)-n-1)
